{"k":"ind","t":"Indefinite Integration","cls":"12","u":"Calculus","s":[["Standard integrals",[{"q":"Power and exponential","f":"\\int x^n\\,dx=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+C\\ (n\\ne-1),\\quad\\int\\frac{dx}x=\\ln|x|+C,\\quad\\int e^x\\,dx=e^x+C,\\quad\\int a^x\\,dx=\\frac{a^x}{\\ln a}+C"},{"q":"Trigonometric integrals","f":"\\int\\sin x=-\\cos x,\\ \\int\\cos x=\\sin x,\\ \\int\\sec^2x=\\tan x,\\ \\int\\csc^2x=-\\cot x,\\ \\int\\sec x\\tan x=\\sec x,\\ \\int\\csc x\\cot x=-\\csc x"},{"q":"Integrals of tan, cot, sec, csc","f":"\\int\\tan x\\,dx=\\ln|\\sec x|,\\quad\\int\\cot x\\,dx=\\ln|\\sin x|,\\quad\\int\\sec x\\,dx=\\ln|\\sec x+\\tan x|,\\quad\\int\\csc x\\,dx=\\ln\\left|\\tan\\tfrac x2\\right|","n":"$\\int\\sec x\\,dx=\\ln\\left|\\tan\\left(\\frac\\pi4+\\frac x2\\right)\\right|$; $\\int\\csc x\\,dx=\\ln|\\csc x-\\cot x|$.","d":"$\\int\\sec x\\,dx=\\int\\frac{\\sec x(\\sec x+\\tan x)}{\\sec x+\\tan x}dx$; numerator is the derivative of the denominator."},{"q":"Standard algebraic forms (1)","f":"\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2+a^2}=\\frac1a\\tan^{-1}\\frac xa,\\quad\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}}=\\sin^{-1}\\frac xa","n":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{x\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}}=\\frac1a\\sec^{-1}\\frac xa$."},{"q":"Standard algebraic forms (2)","f":"\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2-a^2}=\\frac1{2a}\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-a}{x+a}\\right|,\\quad\\int\\frac{dx}{a^2-x^2}=\\frac1{2a}\\ln\\left|\\frac{a+x}{a-x}\\right|","d":"Partial fractions: $\\frac1{x^2-a^2}=\\frac1{2a}\\left(\\frac1{x-a}-\\frac1{x+a}\\right)$."},{"q":"Standard algebraic forms (3)","f":"\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}}=\\ln\\left|x+\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}\\right|"},{"q":"Square-root integrals","f":"\\int\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}\\,dx=\\frac x2\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}+\\frac{a^2}2\\sin^{-1}\\frac xa","n":"$\\int\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}\\,dx=\\frac x2\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}\\pm\\frac{a^2}2\\ln\\left|x+\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}\\right|$.","d":"By parts with $u=\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}$, $dv=dx$, then add the integral back to both sides."},{"q":"Integrals of hyperbolic and exponential forms","f":"\\int\\sinh x\\,dx=\\cosh x,\\quad\\int\\cosh x\\,dx=\\sinh x,\\quad\\int e^{ax+b}dx=\\frac1ae^{ax+b}"},{"q":"Integrals of $\\sec^3x$ and $\\csc^3x$","f":"\\int\\sec^3x\\,dx=\\frac12\\sec x\\tan x+\\frac12\\ln|\\sec x+\\tan x|+C"},{"q":"Integrals of $\\sin^2x$, $\\cos^2x$, $\\tan^2x$","f":"\\int\\sin^2x=\\frac x2-\\frac{\\sin2x}4,\\quad\\int\\cos^2x=\\frac x2+\\frac{\\sin2x}4,\\quad\\int\\tan^2x=\\tan x-x"},{"q":"Integrals of $\\sin^3x$, $\\cos^3x$","f":"\\int\\sin^3x\\,dx=-\\cos x+\\frac{\\cos^3x}3+C,\\qquad\\int\\cos^3x\\,dx=\\sin x-\\frac{\\sin^3x}3+C"},{"q":"Products of sines and cosines","f":"\\int\\sin mx\\cos nx\\,dx=-\\frac{\\cos(m+n)x}{2(m+n)}-\\frac{\\cos(m-n)x}{2(m-n)}\\quad(m\\ne n)"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{x(x^n+1)}$","f":"\\frac1n\\ln\\left|\\frac{x^n}{x^n+1}\\right|+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{(x-a)(b-x)}}$ and $\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{(x-a)(x-b)}}$","f":"2\\sin^{-1}\\sqrt{\\frac{x-a}{b-a}}+C;\\qquad2\\ln\\left|\\sqrt{x-a}+\\sqrt{x-b}\\right|+C"}]],["Techniques",[{"q":"Integration by parts","f":"\\int u\\,v\\,dx=u\\int v\\,dx-\\int\\left(u'\\int v\\,dx\\right)dx","h":"ILATE: Inverse, Log, Algebraic, Trig, Exponential — choose $u$ from the left."},{"q":"The $e^x$ special form","f":"\\int e^x\\left[f(x)+f'(x)\\right]dx=e^xf(x)+C","n":"Also $\\int\\left[f(x)+xf'(x)\\right]dx=xf(x)+C$."},{"q":"Exponential × trig","f":"\\int e^{ax}\\sin bx\\,dx=\\frac{e^{ax}}{a^2+b^2}(a\\sin bx-b\\cos bx)+C","n":"$\\int e^{ax}\\cos bx\\,dx=\\frac{e^{ax}}{a^2+b^2}(a\\cos bx+b\\sin bx)+C$."},{"q":"Derivative over function","f":"\\int\\frac{f'(x)}{f(x)}dx=\\ln|f(x)|+C,\\qquad\\int\\frac{f'(x)}{\\sqrt{f(x)}}dx=2\\sqrt{f(x)}+C","n":"$\\int[f(x)]^nf'(x)\\,dx=\\frac{[f(x)]^{n+1}}{n+1}+C$."},{"q":"Linear substitution","f":"\\int f(ax+b)\\,dx=\\frac1aF(ax+b)+C"},{"q":"By parts with a cyclic integral","f":"I=\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx\\ \\Rightarrow\\ 2I=e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ I=\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)"},{"q":"Integration by parts: tabular (repeated)","f":"\\int x^ne^{ax}dx:\\ \\text{alternate signs of } u,u',u'',\\ldots\\ \\text{times successive integrals of } e^{ax}"},{"q":"$\\int e^x\\frac{x-1}{x^2}dx$ type","f":"\\int e^x\\left(\\frac1x-\\frac1{x^2}\\right)dx=\\frac{e^x}x+C"},{"q":"$\\int e^{x}\\frac{1+\\sin x}{1+\\cos x}dx$","f":"e^x\\tan\\frac x2+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{f'(x)}{f(x)\\ln f(x)}dx$","f":"\\ln|\\ln f(x)|+C"},{"q":"Integral of $f'(x)g(x)+f(x)g'(x)$","f":"f(x)g(x)+C;\\qquad\\int\\frac{f'g-fg'}{g^2}=\\frac fg+C"}]],["Standard substitutions",[{"q":"Quadratic in the denominator","f":"\\int\\frac{dx}{ax^2+bx+c}:\\ \\text{complete the square}","n":"$\\int\\frac{px+q}{ax^2+bx+c}dx$: write $px+q=A\\frac d{dx}(ax^2+bx+c)+B$. Same for $\\sqrt{ax^2+bx+c}$."},{"q":"Trig rational: $\\int\\frac{dx}{a+b\\cos x}$","f":"t=\\tan\\tfrac x2:\\ \\ \\cos x=\\frac{1-t^2}{1+t^2},\\ \\sin x=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2},\\ dx=\\frac{2\\,dt}{1+t^2}"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{a\\sin^2x+b\\cos^2x+c}$","f":"\\text{divide by } \\cos^2x,\\ \\text{put } t=\\tan x"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{a\\sin x+b\\cos x}{c\\sin x+d\\cos x}dx$","f":"\\text{Numerator}=A(\\text{Denominator})+B(\\text{Denominator})'"},{"q":"Powers of sin and cos","f":"\\int\\sin^mx\\cos^nx\\,dx:\\ m\\ \\text{odd}\\to t=\\cos x;\\ n\\ \\text{odd}\\to t=\\sin x;\\ m+n\\ \\text{negative even}\\to t=\\tan x"},{"q":"Irrational substitutions","f":"\\int\\frac{dx}{(ax+b)\\sqrt{cx+d}}:\\ t^2=cx+d;\\qquad\\int\\frac{dx}{(px+q)\\sqrt{ax^2+bx+c}}:\\ px+q=\\frac1t","n":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{(ax^2+b)\\sqrt{cx^2+d}}$: $x=\\frac1t$, then $u^2=c+dt^2$."},{"q":"Euler substitutions / trigonometric forms","f":"\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}:\\ x=a\\sin\\theta;\\quad\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}:\\ x=a\\tan\\theta;\\quad\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}:\\ x=a\\sec\\theta","n":"$\\sqrt{\\frac{a-x}{a+x}}$: $x=a\\cos2\\theta$. $\\sqrt{(x-\\alpha)(\\beta-x)}$: $x=\\alpha\\cos^2\\theta+\\beta\\sin^2\\theta$."},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{x^2\\pm1}{x^4+kx^2+1}dx$","f":"\\text{divide by } x^2:\\ \\frac{1\\pm\\frac1{x^2}}{x^2+\\frac1{x^2}+k};\\ \\ t=x\\mp\\frac1x","n":"Used for $\\int\\sqrt{\\tan x}\\,dx$ and $\\int\\frac{dx}{x^4+1}$."},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{a+b\\sin x}$ ($a^2>b^2$)","f":"\\frac2{\\sqrt{a^2-b^2}}\\tan^{-1}\\frac{a\\tan\\frac x2+b}{\\sqrt{a^2-b^2}}+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{a\\sin x+b\\cos x}$","f":"\\frac1{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}}\\ln\\left|\\tan\\left(\\frac x2+\\frac\\phi2\\right)\\right|+C,\\quad\\tan\\phi=\\frac ba"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{a+b\\cos^2x}$","f":"\\text{divide by } \\cos^2x,\\ t=\\tan x:\\ \\int\\frac{dt}{at^2+(a+b)}"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)}$ with $\\deg P\\ge\\deg Q$","f":"\\text{divide first, then partial fractions}"},{"q":"$\\int x^m(a+bx^n)^p dx$ (binomial differential)","f":"p\\in\\mathbb Z:\\ \\text{expand};\\ \\tfrac{m+1}n\\in\\mathbb Z:\\ t^k=a+bx^n;\\ \\tfrac{m+1}n+p\\in\\mathbb Z:\\ t^k=ax^{-n}+b"},{"q":"Integrals of the form $\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+a^2)^2}$","f":"\\frac x{2a^2(x^2+a^2)}+\\frac1{2a^3}\\tan^{-1}\\frac xa+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\sqrt{\\tan x}\\,dx$","f":"\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\tan^{-1}\\frac{\\tan x-1}{\\sqrt{2\\tan x}}+\\frac1{2\\sqrt2}\\ln\\left|\\frac{\\tan x-\\sqrt{2\\tan x}+1}{\\tan x+\\sqrt{2\\tan x}+1}\\right|+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{x^4+1}$ and $\\int\\frac{x^2dx}{x^4+1}$","f":"\\int\\frac{x^2+1}{x^4+1}=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\tan^{-1}\\frac{x^2-1}{\\sqrt2x},\\qquad\\int\\frac{x^2-1}{x^4+1}=\\frac1{2\\sqrt2}\\ln\\left|\\frac{x^2-\\sqrt2x+1}{x^2+\\sqrt2x+1}\\right|","n":"Add or subtract and halve for the individual integrals."}]],["Partial fractions",[{"q":"Partial fraction forms","f":"\\frac{px+q}{(x-a)(x-b)}=\\frac A{x-a}+\\frac B{x-b};\\quad\\frac{\\cdots}{(x-a)^2}=\\frac A{x-a}+\\frac B{(x-a)^2};\\quad\\frac{\\cdots}{(x-a)(x^2+bx+c)}=\\frac A{x-a}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+bx+c}","n":"Cover-up rule for linear factors: $A=\\left.\\frac{px+q}{x-b}\\right|_{x=a}$."},{"q":"Repeated quadratic factor","f":"\\frac{\\cdots}{(x^2+bx+c)^2}=\\frac{Ax+B}{x^2+bx+c}+\\frac{Cx+D}{(x^2+bx+c)^2}"},{"q":"Trick for $\\frac{1}{(x+a)(x+b)}$","f":"\\frac1{(x+a)(x+b)}=\\frac1{b-a}\\left(\\frac1{x+a}-\\frac1{x+b}\\right)"},{"q":"Substitution $x^2=t$ for even rational functions","f":"\\frac{x^2}{(x^2+a^2)(x^2+b^2)}=\\frac1{a^2-b^2}\\left(\\frac{a^2}{x^2+a^2}-\\frac{b^2}{x^2+b^2}\\right)"}]],["Reduction formulae",[{"q":"Reduction for $\\sin^n x$ and $\\cos^nx$","f":"I_n=\\int\\sin^nx\\,dx=-\\frac{\\sin^{n-1}x\\cos x}n+\\frac{n-1}nI_{n-2}"},{"q":"Reduction for $\\tan^n x$","f":"I_n=\\frac{\\tan^{n-1}x}{n-1}-I_{n-2}"},{"q":"Reduction for $\\sec^n x$","f":"I_n=\\frac{\\sec^{n-2}x\\tan x}{n-1}+\\frac{n-2}{n-1}I_{n-2}"}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Useful results","f":"\\int\\frac{dx}{1+\\sin x}=\\tan x-\\sec x+C,\\qquad\\int\\frac{dx}{1+\\cos x}=\\tan\\frac x2+C","n":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sin x\\cos x}=\\ln|\\tan x|+C$; $\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sin^2x\\cos^2x}=\\tan x-\\cot x+C$."},{"q":"Log integrals","f":"\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C,\\qquad\\int\\frac{\\ln x}x\\,dx=\\frac{(\\ln x)^2}2+C"},{"q":"Inverse trig integrals","f":"\\int\\sin^{-1}x\\,dx=x\\sin^{-1}x+\\sqrt{1-x^2}+C,\\qquad\\int\\tan^{-1}x\\,dx=x\\tan^{-1}x-\\tfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sin(x-a)\\sin(x-b)}$","f":"\\frac1{\\sin(a-b)}\\ln\\left|\\frac{\\sin(x-a)}{\\sin(x-b)}\\right|+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{\\sin x}{\\sin(x+a)}dx$","f":"x\\cos a-\\sin a\\ln|\\sin(x+a)|+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{\\cos(x-a)\\cos(x-b)}$","f":"\\frac1{\\sin(a-b)}\\ln\\left|\\frac{\\cos(x-a)}{\\cos(x-b)}\\right|+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sin x+\\cos x}$","f":"\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\ln\\left|\\tan\\left(\\frac x2+\\frac\\pi8\\right)\\right|+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}}$, $\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+a^2)^{3/2}}$","f":"-\\frac{\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}}{a^2x}+C;\\qquad\\frac x{a^2\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}+C"},{"q":"$\\int\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+a^2})\\,dx$","f":"x\\ln\\left(x+\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}\\right)-\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}+C"}]],["If this type comes, solve like this",[{"q":"If the answer form is given with unknown constants ($\\alpha\\ln|\\ldots|+\\beta\\tan^{-1}\\ldots$)","f":"\\text{differentiate the given answer and match with the integrand}","n":"Often faster than integrating: compare coefficients after differentiating, or pick the right split of the numerator (Numerator $=A(\\text{Den})+B(\\text{Den})'$).","p":"6 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 25 times"},{"q":"If the integrand is $\\frac{x^2\\pm1}{x^4+kx^2+1}$ or contains $\\frac{x^2+1}x$","f":"\\text{divide by } x^2,\\ t=x\\mp\\frac1x","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 8 times"},{"q":"If $\\sin$ and $\\cos$ appear with fractional/negative powers adding to an even negative integer","f":"\\sin^mx\\cos^nx,\\ m+n=-2k:\\ \\text{divide by } \\cos^{m+n}x,\\ t=\\tan x\\ (\\text{or } \\cot x)","p":"3 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 10 times"},{"q":"If it is $\\int\\frac{dx}{(x-a)^p(x-b)^q}$ with $p+q=2$","f":"t=\\frac{x-a}{x-b}\\Rightarrow dt=\\frac{(a-b)\\,dx}{(x-b)^2}","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"},{"q":"If it has two different roots of $x$ like $x^{2/3}$, $x^{1/2}$","f":"x=t^{\\text{LCM of denominators}}","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"},{"q":"If it is $\\int e^x[f+f']$ or $\\int[f+xf']$ in disguise","f":"\\int e^x(f+f')=e^xf;\\qquad\\int\\frac{x^2}{(x\\sin x+\\cos x)^2}:\\ \\text{write as }\\frac{x}{\\cos x}\\cdot\\frac{x\\cos x}{(\\ldots)^2}\\ \\text{and use parts}","p":"3 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 12 times"},{"q":"If it is $\\int x^n\\sin x$ or $\\int x^ne^x$","f":"\\text{tabular integration by parts}","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 6 times"},{"q":"If it is $\\int\\frac{dx}{(ax^2+b)\\sqrt{cx^2+d}}$ or $\\frac1x\\sqrt{\\frac{1-x}{1+x}}$","f":"x=\\frac1t\\ \\text{then } u^2=c+dt^2;\\qquad x=\\cos2\\theta\\ \\text{for }\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1-x}{1+x}}","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 5 times"},{"q":"If it is $\\int\\frac{(\\text{poly})}{\\sqrt{\\text{quadratic}}}$","f":"\\text{write poly}=A\\,(\\text{quad})'\\cdot x+\\ldots;\\ \\text{use } \\int\\sqrt{Q},\\ \\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt Q}","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 2 times"},{"q":"If it has $\\sqrt{1+x^2}+x$ powers","f":"t=\\sqrt{1+x^2}+x\\Rightarrow\\frac1t=\\sqrt{1+x^2}-x,\\ dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1+\\frac1{t^2}\\right)dt","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 1 time"},{"q":"If the integrand is a derivative of a quotient (rational with high powers)","f":"\\frac{f'g-fg'}{g^2}\\ \\text{pattern: divide num and den by } x^{k}\\ \\text{to expose it}","n":"E.g. $\\frac{7x^{10}+9x^8}{(1+x^2+2x^9)^2}$: divide by $x^{18}$, the denominator becomes $(x^{-9}+x^{-7}+2)^2$.","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"}]]]}